{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj41h9axUNdJunJ91Lyq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place with a heavy, satisfying resonance that vibrates through the frame.\n\nI am shut. I am sealed. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safe and unsafe — and you will not know which side is which until you decide to open me.\n\nThe deadbolt is thrown. The latch is set. The wood grain tightens.\n\nI hold.\n\n**🔒**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":104,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}